  "solution": "Given:\n\n2 + 3 ÷ 2 of (3)/(2) + 2 ( {4 times 2 div 2 of (1)/(2) + 2 - (1)/(2)} )\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/36648f6d9fd5d1d56959b630c72b514ab488f27d2525de3370bb428cc41cf8e9.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n2 + 3 ÷ 2 of (3)/(2) + 2 ( {4 times 2 div 2 of (1)/(2) + 2 - (1)/(2)} )\n\n2 + 3 ÷ 2 of (3)/(2) + 2 ( {4 times 2 div 1 + 2 - (1)/(2)} )\n\n⇒ 2 + 3 ÷ 2 of (3)/(2) + 2 ( {4 times 2 + 2 - (1)/(2)} )\n\n⇒ 2 + 3 ÷ 2 of (3)/(2) + 2 ( {8 + 2 - (1)/(2)} )\n\n⇒ 2 + 3 ÷ 2 of (3)/(2) + 2 ( {10 - (1)/(2)} )\n\n⇒ 2 + 3 ÷ 2 of (3)/(2) + 2 ( {(20 - 1)/(2)} )\n\n⇒ 2 + 3 ÷ 2 of (3)/(2) + 2 ( {(19)/(2)} )\n\n⇒ 2 + 3 ÷ 2 of (3)/(2) + 19\n\n⇒ 2 + 3 ÷ 3 + 19\n\n⇒ 2 + 1 + 19\n\n⇒ 22\n\n∴ Required answer is 22.",
